OL,3,GNEWSADr ATM: From data analyst to DJ
OL,4,
OL,5,FWhen NHS data analyst Michael Tobi
OL,6,FAkindele was told his job no longer met
OL,7,Fthe requirements for sponsorship it
OL,8,Fthreatened to turn his life upside
OL,9,Fdown.
OL,11,FWith just five months left on his visa
OL,12,Fwhen his contract ended, he was faced
OL,13,Fwith returning to Nigeria if he could
OL,14,Fnot find work.
OL,16,FBut in just a few months, the
OL,17,F31-year-old who lives in Telford, has
OL,18,Fturned his life around. He has turned
OL,19,Fhis hobby into his career and has gone
OL,20,Ffrom data analyst to Afrobeats DJ,
OL,21,Fentertaining fans up and down the
OL,22,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
