OL,3,GNEWSADr ATM: From data analyst to DJ
OL,4,
OL,5,FHis talent for producing, song-writing
OL,6,Fand performing saw him successfully
OL,7,Fapply for a global talent visa and he
OL,8,Fis now hoping to collaborate with more
OL,9,FUK artists as his career progresses.
